# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Lesson 1: Open Strings|第1课 认识空弦
artist: Exercise|练习
bpm: 60
time: 4/4
level: 1
desc: Play from the thickest string 6 to the thinnest string 1, four times on each open string, then back again. Remember the string names: 6 E, 5 A, 4 D, 3 G, 2 B, 1 E.|从最粗的 6 弦弹到最细的 1 弦, 每根空弦弹 4 下, 再弹回来. 记住弦名: 6弦E 5弦A 4弦D 3弦G 2弦B 1弦E.
desc: Tip: pick gently downward and touch only one string at a time; the left hand doesn't press anything yet - keep your eyes on the next string.|小贴士: 拨片轻轻向下拨, 每次只碰一根弦; 左手先不用按, 眼睛看准下一根弦.
---
